<title>USA: Heinz Weight Watchers Gourmet CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>Heinz Weight Watchers Gourmet CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH, Pa 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.J. Heinz Co said Friday that Michael McGrath had resigned as president and chief executive officer of Weight Watchers Gourmet Food Co to pursue other career interests.  </p>
<p>The company said McGrath had agreed to remain on special assignment with Heinz until the company found someone to replace him.</p>
